{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have integrated card games, Roguelike, and auto-battling chess to create this single-player board game. Match the strongest exploration team, build a unique deck, discover new events, and adventure through vast worlds!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have introduced a Bond system in Auto Chess, where you can match different teams according to the requirements of various levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965840/extras/d0fc702c22dae01f15c8e7c819f17c74.poster.avif?t=1761730058\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965840/extras/d0fc702c22dae01f15c8e7c819f17c74.webm?t=1761730058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965840/extras/d0fc702c22dae01f15c8e7c819f17c74.mp4?t=1761730058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the chess pieces, the cards you construct will also be powerful aids in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965840/extras/1d78081915cae36189e8dea329588f38.poster.avif?t=1761730058\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965840/extras/1d78081915cae36189e8dea329588f38.webm?t=1761730058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965840/extras/1d78081915cae36189e8dea329588f38.mp4?t=1761730058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every adventuro